<section class="service-page">
  <div class="container">
    
    <!-- Hero Section with Image -->
    <div class="service-hero">
      <div class="service-hero-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">Court-Connected Mediation</span>
        <h1>Legal System & Court-Connected Mediation Services</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Efficient, Court-Approved Dispute Resolution — Without Prolonged Litigation</p>
        <p class="lead">At Valor Mediation, LLC, we provide trusted legal system and court-connected mediation services in Texas and nationwide, helping individuals, attorneys, and businesses resolve disputes efficiently — often before a case reaches trial.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn">Schedule Free Consultation</a>
      </div>
      <div class="service-hero-image">
        <img src="/images/legal/1.jpg" alt="Legal mediation professional at work" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Intro Section -->
    <div class="service-section">
      <p>Whether your case is court-ordered in Dallas, part of a pre-litigation process in Houston, or a small claims dispute in Austin, our virtual mediation services offer a faster, cost-effective, and confidential alternative to courtroom proceedings.</p>
      <p>All sessions are conducted securely via Zoom, allowing all parties to participate from anywhere with flexibility and privacy.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Two Column Layout with Image -->
    <div class="service-split">
      <div class="service-split-content">
        <h2>What is Court-Connected Mediation?</h2>
        <p>Court-connected mediation is a structured dispute resolution process often required or recommended by courts, where a neutral mediator helps parties reach an agreement before going to trial.</p>
        
        <p>If you're searching:</p>
        <ul class="search-list">
          <li>"What is court-ordered mediation in Texas?"</li>
          <li>"Do I need a mediator before going to court?"</li>
          <li>"Online mediation for legal disputes USA"</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Valor Mediation, LLC provides professional guidance every step of the way.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-split-image">
        <img src="/images/legal/2.jpg" alt="Legal documents and mediation agreement" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>

