    <div class="service-section highlight">
      <h2>Types of Legal & Court-Related Cases We Mediate</h2>
      <p>We assist clients across Texas and the United States with:</p>
      <ul class="feature-list">
        <li>Court-ordered mediation cases</li>
        <li>Pre-litigation dispute resolution</li>
        <li>Small claims mediation</li>
        <li>Civil and business disputes</li>
        <li>Contract and financial disagreements</li>
        <li>Property and real estate disputes</li>
        <li>Employment-related legal conflicts</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Why Choose Us -->
    <div class="service-section">
      <h2>Why Choose Valor Mediation, LLC</h2>
      <div class="benefits-grid">
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Experienced, Neutral Mediation</strong>
          <span>Certified mediator with background in business, negotiation, and conflict resolution</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Independent from Legal Representation</strong>
          <span>Not a law firm - we remain neutral and unbiased, focused solely on resolution</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Streamlined Legal Resolution</strong>
          <span>Reduce court backlog and delays, save time and legal costs</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Flexible Virtual Mediation</strong>
          <span>Attend from anywhere via Zoom, schedule around your availability</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>High Ethical Standards</strong>
          <span>Confidential, respectful, and legally sound process at all times</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Top Reasons -->
    <div class="service-section">
      <h2>Top Reasons to Choose Mediation Over Court</h2>
      <div class="benefits-grid">
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Faster Resolution</strong>
          <span>Avoid months or years of litigation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Cost Savings</strong>
          <span>Reduce attorney fees and court expenses</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Confidential Process</strong>
          <span>Keep disputes private</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Control the Outcome</strong>
          <span>Agreements are mutually decided</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Less Adversarial</strong>
          <span>Reduce stress and conflict</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Flexible Agreements</strong>
          <span>Tailored solutions beyond court limitations</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Higher Compliance Rates</strong>
          <span>Parties are more likely to follow agreements</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MSA Section -->
    <div class="service-section">
      <h2>Legally Binding Agreements (MSA Validity)</h2>
      <p>At the conclusion of mediation, agreements are formalized in a Mediation Settlement Agreement (MSA):</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Legally binding and enforceable in court</li>
        <li>Clearly outlines terms and obligations</li>
        <li>Can be submitted for court approval</li>
        <li>Provides a faster and more predictable resolution than trial</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Courts recognize MSAs as valid contracts, giving you confidence and legal protection.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Service Areas -->
    <div class="service-section accent">
      
      <p>We provide court-connected mediation services throughout Texas, including:</p>
      <div class="city-list">
        Dallas · Fort Worth · Houston · Austin · San Antonio · Plano · Arlington · Irving · Garland · Frisco · McKinney · Denton
      </div>
      <p>Our online mediation services also allow us to assist clients anywhere in the United States.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Who We Serve -->
