      <div class="contact-info">
        <p><strong>Call Now:</strong> <a href="tel:+18179084070">817-908-4070</a></p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:rex@valormediation.com">rex@valormediation.com</a></p>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-large">Schedule Your Free Consultation Today</a>
